      "widgets_values": [
        "NATIVE PIXEL ICON 128\n\nSDXL cannot form a unit at 128 or 256 latent. This graph uses 512 (the lowest reliable size with Pixel Art XL), then Pixel1 quantization at exact 128 with no dither.\n\nChange only the UNIT TYPE in the positive prompt. Keep the style prefix, view, olive/khaki words, LoRA 0.6-0.8, sampler, and Pixel1 converter connected.\n\nSampler: 28 steps, euler_ancestral, karras, CFG 7. Trigger: pixelbuildings128."
      ],
      "title": "How to batch units"
